c":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/28/3820423/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれも含め握手は楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会楽しいいいい\nいつも元気をありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、握手会のとき裏声で\nしゃべってるの知ってました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイテンションのときは\n基本裏声なんです。たぶん\nあのね、話してて裏声か地声か\n区別つかないんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方によく\nイメージと違う声とテンション\nってよく言われるの。\n良い意味かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/28/3820423/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-hfc2b5d39b7":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は第3週だよ！SOL！ガールズロックス♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくれたー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は逆電ウィーク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と同時に、かみみんウィークでもある笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-26.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かみみんTシャツ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0001-26.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週のガールズロックスを聴いていれば、どこかでかみみんTシャツのプレゼントが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ着て握手会に来て！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界で限定