 　　　　　　　　　　　サリマカシー♡"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-hina-27595":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ～🔔*゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！日向坂46  金村美玖です❄"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/201903/mob0vylm0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬が終わる前にケヤキセさんの冬服コーデ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ…今年は雪あんまり見ませんでしたね。去年は雪で道路が渋滞したの鮮明に覚えています。懐かしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく時間ギリギリで焦って薄着で出かけてしまう金村なのですが、今回はニット帽に手袋と防寒ばっちりの格好で撮影しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芽実さんが冬の女の子が一番可愛いと言っていたのですが、みなさんはどの季節の女の子が好きですか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬はモコモコしてて可愛いですね🧸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは春のシーズン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新たなお洋服探し中です❀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケヤキセさんの他のガチャにも登場しているので是非アプリでチェックしてみて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/201903/mobqywBxv.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"ty